    "CLI produces region data, not level.dat or a fully initialized playable save.",
    "Runtime platform identities must exist and bind; content-mod block implementations are not made portable by the snapshot.",
    "Bukkit, CraftBukkit and launch wrappers are outside this delivery.",
    "Historical deferred End records have a narrow one-time mod support upgrade with original-byte backup; supported saved records are never recompiled."
